<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade. [CORRECTED 15:07 GMT]</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade. [CORRECTED 15:07 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three stocks rose, three fell and seven were flat in a 14.2-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>The remaining eight stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell two percent (Corrects from 2.4 percent) in 25.9-million-zloty trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
